    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Health check API and admin API (used for privileged operations) are exposed on the same network port, which could lead to unintentional exposure of admin functions - High Description: If an attacker has access to Load Balancer, then you can perform Admin tasks or admin-related activities by calling the API directly from Load Balancer machines. This allows anyone with access to the URL to perform privileged actions without verification. Impact: Privilege escalation and unintentional exposure of admin functions.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

